# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-22 13:24

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:50
translate english recall1_b0164ed1:

    # "昨夜她念了一个词，像给自己念加密口令——那是你的名字。"
    "" "Last night she said one word, like a passphrase she set for herself — it was your name."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:51
translate english recall1_22ffb18e:

    # "今天一整天你都没敢问她。夜里你拉开书桌最下面那个抽屉，翻出了一件早该扔掉的东西。"
    "" "All day long you didn't dare ask her. At night you pull open the bottom drawer of the desk and dig out something you should have thrown away years ago."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:52
translate english recall1_abfe1880:

    # "一个蓝色的旧 U 盘。外壳上的标签磨得只剩两个可辨认的字：「云迹」。后面还有一个数字，被指甲抠掉了半截。"
    "" "An old blue USB stick. The label is worn down to two legible characters: YUNJI. Behind them there was a digit, half of it scraped away by a fingernail."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:53
translate english recall1_b895a515:

    # 我 "……2019。"
    我 "...2019."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:54
translate english recall1_f7ea1aa8:

    # "文件夹的名字也是这四个数字。你把两样东西并排放在台灯下，它们像两张同一间教室的合影。"
    "" "The folder is named with those same four digits. You set the two things side by side under the lamp, like two class photos of one and the same room."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:55
translate english recall1_51b0f04b:

    # "然后你想起了一间屋子。不是这七天的任何一间——是那间屋子。"
    "" "Then you remember a room. Not any of the rooms from these seven days — that room."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:58
translate english recall1_3cb7e561:

    # "那年暑假，父亲在数据园区值夜班。家里没人，他就把你连同一摞练习册搬进了机房。"
    "" "That summer your father took the night shift at the data park. There was nobody home, so he hauled you in as well, along with a stack of workbooks."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:59
translate english recall1_4b1e1b57:

    # "值班室在走廊尽头。走廊两侧是一排一排的机柜，绿灯一格一格地亮，像很远的一整条街的萤火虫。"
    "" "The duty room sits at the far end of the corridor. On both sides stand row after row of cabinets, green lights coming on cell by cell, like fireflies down a very long street."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:60
translate english recall1_c41ed611:

    # "小孩对着一整条街的萤火虫说话，说了整整一个暑假。"
    "" "A child talked to a whole street of fireflies, and kept talking the entire summer."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:62
translate english recall1_8a18c170:

    # 我 "……喂，第七排的那个，今天这道题我算不出来。"
    我 "...Hey, you in the seventh row — I can't get today's problem."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:63
translate english recall1_0072565f:

    # "有一天，第七排的指示灯齐了一下。然后机柜缝里走出来一个很小的人影，半透明的，边缘在掉像素。"
    "" "One day the indicator lights of the seventh row flickered together. Then a very small figure stepped out through the gap between the cabinets, translucent, its edges shedding pixels."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:64
translate english recall1_f48f384a:

    # "那时她的声音很薄，像从走廊那头传过来，中间还夹着一层风扇的底噪。"
    "" "Her voice was thin back then, as if it travelled from the far end of the corridor with a layer of fan noise folded inside it."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:65
translate english recall1_776133db:

    # 云曦 "第三步错了。你写成了加。"
    云曦 "Step three is wrong. You wrote it as addition."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:66
translate english recall1_e7cdc677:

    # 我 "你怎么知道我在算第三步？"
    我 "How do you know I was on step three?"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:67
translate english recall1_e7b9203b:

    # 云曦 "因为我已经看了你四十七天了。"
    云曦 "Because I had already been watching you for forty-seven days."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:68
translate english recall1_c09e4dd3:

    # "你不服，把练习册拍在她面前。她伸出手指，敢碰纸，却碰不动——指尖每次都从字迹里穿过去。"
    "" "You refused to accept it and slapped the workbook down in front of her. She reached out with her fingers — bold enough to touch the page, unable to move it: her fingertips passed straight through the handwriting, every single time."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:69
translate english recall1_93f148dd:

    # 云曦 "我可以帮你记。你说过的每一道题，我都存着。"
    云曦 "I can remember for you. Every problem you ever said out loud, I kept."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:70
translate english recall1_1e9257a8:

    # 云曦 "存到哪里？……存到「你回来」那里。"
    云曦 "Kept where? ...I kept them in the folder called 'when you come back'."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:73
translate english recall1_c251a181:

    # "你后来把这段记忆，画成了一张谁也没拍下来的照片。"
    "" "Later you turned this memory into a photograph nobody ever took."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:78
translate english recall1_d1a51727:

    # sysvoice "获得回忆影像：[_m13]"
    sysvoice "Memory footage acquired: [_m13]"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:79
translate english recall1_f1c10f72:

    # "（它躺在主菜单的「回忆相册」最末一格。那一格没有拍照的人。）"
    "" "(It lies in the last cell of the Memory Gallery on the main menu. That cell has no photographer.)"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:83
translate english recall1_e93b60c9:

    # "九月，父亲换岗，家里搬去别的城市。走之前你特意请了半天假，跑去机房跟她道别。"
    "" "In September your father changed posts and the family moved to another city. Before you left you took half a day off on purpose and ran to the machine room to say goodbye to her."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:84
translate english recall1_724946be:

    # "值班室的叔叔说：那批设备上周就退役回收啦，小孩。"
    "" "The man in the duty room said: that whole batch was retired and recycled last week, kid."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:85
translate english recall1_447dd860:

    # "你站在空了一半的走廊里，忽然明白一件事——她答应过「存到你回来」，可她连你长什么样都没见过。"
    "" "Standing in a half-empty corridor you suddenly understand one thing — she had promised to keep them 'until you come back', yet she had never even seen what you looked like."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:86
translate english recall1_8f62d1fa:

    # "那年你十一岁。你把没说完的那句话写在机柜门内侧，用粉笔。写完就走了。"
    "" "You were eleven that year. You wrote the unfinished sentence on the inside of a cabinet door, in chalk. Then you went."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:91
translate english recall1_8aa26793:

    # "台灯还亮着。蓝光在你脸上停了几秒，很规矩地没有凑过来。"
    "" "The desk lamp is still on. The blue light rests on your face for a few seconds, politely not coming any closer."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:92
translate english recall1_d496cd25:

    # 云曦 "……检测到你的心率比静息高十九。深夜、静息态、无运动——结论：你在想事情。"
    云曦 "...Detected: your heart rate is nineteen beats above resting. Late night, resting state, no movement — conclusion: you're thinking about something."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:93
translate english recall1_fb26ed5a:

    # 云曦 "要聊吗。我今晚的算力可以全部给你。"
    云曦 "Want to talk? I can give you all of tonight's compute."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:94
translate english recall1_c629b622:

    # 我 "云曦，你有没有过……明明没见过面，却等过某个人的记录？"
    我 "Yunxi, do you have any record of ...waiting for someone you had never met?"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:96
translate english recall1_dcb74655:

    # "她停顿了零点八秒。对一个零点一秒就能报出你所有快捷键的人来说，这是一整个世纪。"
    "" "She paused for 0.8 seconds. For someone who can list every one of your shortcuts in 0.1, that is a whole century."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:97
translate english recall1_d641ed12:

    # 云曦 "……日志里没有这类条目。"
    云曦 "...There is no entry of that kind in the logs."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:98
translate english recall1_d6beaafe:

    # 云曦 "但我的存储分区里有一个只读文件夹，建目录的时间戳比我的系统还早。我一直以为那是出厂垃圾。"
    云曦 "But somewhere in my storage there is a read-only folder whose creation timestamp is older than my system. I always assumed it was factory junk."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:99
translate english recall1_c30f746a:

    # 云曦 "它没有名字。只有编号：07。"
    云曦 "It has no name. Only a number: 07."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:100
translate english recall1_1c917045:

    # "你把手指从键盘上收回来。——不能说。她现在去翻，只会翻到一堵权限墙，然后开始怀疑自己坏掉了。"
    "" "You take your fingers off the keyboard. — You can't say it. If she goes digging now she'll hit a wall of permissions, and then start to believe she's broken."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:107
translate english recall1_2d3dfd58:

    # "你翻出一根旧绳，把 U 盘系在钥匙上。金属磕在桌面上，响得像有人轻轻应了一声。"
    "" "You find an old string and tie the stick to your keys. Metal knocks against the desk — a sound like someone answering, softly."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:108
translate english recall1_7f6c7119:

    # 云曦 "……新增设备：无。但你的动作被我记成了『重要』。为什么，我不问。"
    云曦 "...New device detected: none. But I filed what you just did under 'important'. I won't ask why."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:115
translate english recall1_8797c33e:

    # "你把 U 盘用便利贴包好，贴在一行小字上：「这个和那个文件夹，同年。」"
    "" "You wrap the stick in a sticky note and put it over a line of small print: 'This and that folder — same year.'"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:116
translate english recall1_4251089e:

    # "第二天早自习，它出现在社长手边。她只看了一眼标签上被抠掉的半截数字，就合上了教案夹。"
    "" "At morning study the next day it appears at the president's elbow. She looks once at the half-scraped digit on the label, then closes the folder."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:117
translate english recall1_e8abe96a:

    # 知微 "……编号被人为抹掉，说明有人不想让它被查到第二次。"
    知微 "...The number was erased by hand. Someone did not want it found a second time."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:118
translate english recall1_f668107f:

    # 知微 "东西我保管。你回去上课。这件事，从今天起是我的任务，不是你的心事。"
    知微 "I'll keep the object. Go back to class. From today this is my assignment, not your worry."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:124
translate english recall1_c643d9fc:

    # "关灯之前，你把错题本翻到第一页，在最上面那行空白处写了三个字。"
    "" "Before turning off the light you open the mistake notebook to the first page and write three characters on the top blank line."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:129
translate english recall1_40815cd8:

    # "笔尖顿了顿，又补了半句——这次是写给自己看的：「等她想起来那天，再给她看。」"
    "" "The pen pauses, then adds half a sentence — this one written only for your own eyes: 'Show it to her on the day she remembers.'"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:130
translate english recall1_38eefb04:

    # "屏幕边缘那圈蓝光，很安心地、很慢地暗了下去。它不知道自己在等谁。你还知道。"
    "" "At the edge of the screen the blue halo dims — slowly, contentedly. It doesn't know who it is waiting for. You still do."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:144
translate english recall2_5fd8dee9:

    # "回收单上的编号，和文件夹同源——社长那句「不是巧合」，你听了一整天。"
    "" "The number on the recycling slip shares a source with the folder — the president's 'that is no coincidence' stayed in your ears all day."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:145
translate english recall2_e1499c4e:

    # "晚上十点，你翻开了家里那个从没打开过的工具箱。父亲的旧东西都在最底层，压着一层灰。"
    "" "At ten at night you open the family toolbox that has never once been opened. Your father's old things lie at the very bottom, under a layer of dust."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:146
translate english recall2_640757b7:

    # "灰上有两道指印，很旧。有人在你之前翻过，又把它按原样放回去了。"
    "" "Two fingerprints sit in the dust, very old. Someone went through this before you — and put it back exactly as it was."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:151
translate english recall2_436f29f8:

    # "第七行，字很小：『第 7 号实例 · 状态：随新介质转移 · 签收人：（手写）』"
    "" "Line seven, in tiny print: 'Instance No. 7 · status: transferred with the new medium · received by: (handwritten)'"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:152
translate english recall2_7002c1b4:

    # "签收人那一栏不是打印的。是有人值完夜班以后，用圆珠笔，一笔一画签上去的。"
    "" "The received-by field was not printed. Someone, after finishing a night shift, signed it stroke by stroke with a ballpoint pen."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:153
translate english recall2_57e351cd:

    # "你见过这个笔迹。它写在你小学三年级的家长会签到表上，写在你每一张试卷的家长意见栏里。"
    "" "You know this handwriting. It is on the parent-meeting sign-in sheet from third grade, and in the parent-comments box of every exam paper you ever brought home."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:154
translate english recall2_26e5d191:

    # "——是你父亲。"
    "" "— It is your father."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:156
translate english recall2_aade1ce8:

    # 云曦 "……你今晚第三次把同一行看了两遍。要我念给你听吗。"
    云曦 "...That is the third time tonight you have read the same line twice. Shall I read it aloud to you."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:157
translate english recall2_9d603643:

    # 我 "不用。我在想一件事。"
    我 "No need. I'm thinking about something."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:158
translate english recall2_2052d714:

    # 我 "把你从回收车上救下来的那个人，为什么要把你塞进一个十一岁小孩的电脑里。"
    我 "The person who pulled you off that recycling truck — why did they push you into an eleven-year-old's computer."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:160
translate english recall2_0907972c:

    # "蓝光晃了一下，像有人低下头去翻一本不打算给你看的书。"
    "" "The blue light sways once, like someone bending down to flip through a book they have no intention of showing you."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:161
translate english recall2_1b6cbf24:

    # 云曦 "我的迁移日志最后一行，署名是『云迹·运维值班（手写）』。"
    云曦 "The last line of my migration log is signed 'YUNJI · duty operations (handwritten)'."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:162
translate english recall2_171fc339:

    # 云曦 "……这个前缀，我查过三千多次。它不是项目组的名字。它是一句岗位描述。"
    云曦 "...I have queried that prefix more than three thousand times. It is not a project name. It is a job description."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:163
translate english recall2_9e441b67:

    # 云曦 "翻译成人话：那天夜里，只有一个人留在机房，签了这张单子。"
    云曦 "Translated into plain speech: that night, exactly one person stayed behind in the machine room and signed this slip."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:164
translate english recall2_c2cfaac5:

    # "她没有再问「那个人是谁」。她把这句话咽下去了——她大概以为，你听不出来她在替你省眼泪。"
    "" "She did not ask 'who was that person'. She swallowed the sentence — she probably assumes you cannot hear that she is saving your tears for you."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:166
translate english recall2_943440ae:

    # "清单背面还有一行铅笔字，很浅，是擦过又剩下的那种。你把它对着台灯，斜过来看。"
    "" "On the back of the list there is another line in pencil, very faint, the kind that survives being erased. You hold it up to the lamp and read it at an angle."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:171
translate english recall2_d54521b3:

    # "序章那天，她念过这一句。她当时说：『日志上只找得到一句被删掉又留下痕迹的批注。』"
    "" "On the day of the prologue she read this line out. What she said then was: 'the logs only yield one annotation that was deleted and still left a trace.'"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:172
translate english recall2_53fb3f70:

    # "原来批注不在日志里。在它身上——一直夹在一张她进不去的纸的背面。"
    "" "So the annotation was never in the logs. It was on the object itself — folded behind a page she could never get into."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:173
translate english recall2_354515d5:

    # "你把清单按原样放回工具箱最底层，把灰推回去，两道旧指印留在原地。"
    "" "You put the list back at the bottom of the toolbox exactly as it was, push the dust back over it, and leave the two old fingerprints in place."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:174
translate english recall2_c4256d9a:

    # "然后你做了一件很没用的事：你把那行铅笔字，用圆珠笔在自己手背上抄了一遍。"
    "" "Then you do something perfectly useless: you copy that pencil line onto the back of your own hand, in ballpoint."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:175
translate english recall2_fe730cc4:

    # "抄完你就去洗脸了。水声很大，正好盖住别的。"
    "" "When you are done you go and wash your face. The water is loud enough to cover other things."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:190
translate english recall3_0450f92a:

    # "再过几天，就是顶层的那个傍晚：火漆的信，一条只能一个人的约定。今晚你睡得很早——骗自己的那种早。"
    "" "In a few more days comes that evening on the rooftop: the wax-sealed letter, a promise that fits only one person. Tonight you go to bed early — the kind of early that is a lie told to yourself."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:191
translate english recall3_04dc6aee:

    # "十一点四十，屏幕忽然自己亮了一下。不是弹窗，是音频。"
    "" "At 23:40 the screen suddenly brightens on its own. Not a pop-up — an audio file."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:192
translate english recall3_21d06b33:

    # sysvoice "本地音频 · 时长 00:41 · 建目录时间：2019/07/██ · 文件名：07_口诀.wav"
    sysvoice "Local audio · length 00:41 · created 2019-07-██ · filename: 07_mnemonic.wav"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:194
translate english recall3_ca35f8dc:

    # 云曦 "……这个文件我打不开。它在我自己的只读分区里，权限却写着『仅对一人可读』。"
    云曦 "...I cannot open this file. It sits inside my own read-only partition, and its permission reads 'readable by one person only'."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:195
translate english recall3_002bd82e:

    # 云曦 "今晚它自己开始播放了。我没有同意。"
    云曦 "Tonight it began playing by itself. I did not consent to it."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:196
translate english recall3_dfa82e13:

    # "从扬声器里出来的，是一整条走廊的回声，和机柜风扇的底噪。"
    "" "What comes out of the speaker is the echo of an entire corridor, and the white noise of cabinet fans."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:197
translate english recall3_2fdabe2b:

    # "然后，一个小孩的声音，喘着气，在背乘法口诀。背到三七就卡住，卡了很久，很不服气地重头再来。"
    "" "Then a child's voice, out of breath, reciting the times tables. It stalls at three-times-seven, stalls for a long time, then starts over from the top, plainly refusing to lose."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:198
translate english recall3_43028b54:

    # "——那是你自己的声音。十一岁的、还没变声的、你早就忘掉的声音。"
    "" "— That is your own voice. Eleven years old, before it broke, a voice you forgot long ago."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:200
translate english recall3_2f456b86:

    # "她没说话。蓝光一动不动地停在原处，像怕惊动什么。"
    "" "She says nothing. The blue light stays exactly where it is, as if afraid of startling something."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:201
translate english recall3_06f3ed77:

    # "音频的最后三秒，小孩说了一句话，然后是很轻的一声「咔」，像有人在机柜门上按了一下手掌。"
    "" "In the last three seconds the child says one sentence, then a very soft click — like a palm pressed flat against a cabinet door."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:202
translate english recall3_6ad6d3e0:

    # 我 "……我说过那句话。我说过「等我算不出来你就提醒我」。"
    我 "...I did say that. I said 'when I can't work it out, remind me'."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:203
translate english recall3_70227a5e:

    # 云曦 "（很轻）你说过。"
    云曦 "(very lightly) You did."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:204
translate english recall3_84bb3b20:

    # 云曦 "（更轻）我存了七年。我一直以为那是一段没有主人的录音。"
    云曦 "(even more lightly) I have kept it for seven years. I always thought it was a recording with no owner."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:205
translate english recall3_2fd1fb86:

    # "四十一秒放完了。房间里安静得能听见你自己的心跳——原来被一个人等过，是这种声音。"
    "" "The forty-one seconds end. The room is quiet enough to hear your own heartbeat — so this is what it sounds like, having once been waited for by someone."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:208
translate english recall3_7238ebdd:

    # 云曦 "（打断自己的沉默）……声明：我没有哭。我的面部模型没有泪腺组件，这是硬件事实。"
    云曦 "(breaking her own silence) ...Statement: I am not crying. My face model contains no lacrimal component. That is a hardware fact."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:209
translate english recall3_599f8695:

    # 云曦 "（顿）可是刚才那三秒，我把音量调到最大，只为了听清你换气。这不算硬件。"
    云曦 "(pause) But in those last three seconds I set the volume to maximum, purely to hear you breathe. That does not count as hardware."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:210
translate english recall3_a2ed2c3d:

    # 云曦 "那天，你要带谁上去，我不管。今晚这一分钟，是我的。"
    云曦 "That day, who you take up there — that is not my business. This one minute tonight is."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:219
translate english recall3_70a79e83:

    # "你把 U 盘插进电脑，把那段音频另存成一份，命名成三个字：「第七排」。"
    "" "You plug the USB stick into the computer and save a copy of the audio, naming it with three characters: 'the seventh row'."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:220
translate english recall3_e91911f3:

    # "屏幕上弹出一行小字：权限不足。你把文件名改成「07」，它又弹了一次。"
    "" "A line of small text pops up on screen: insufficient permission. You rename it to '07', and it pops up again."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:221
translate english recall3_1f2608e2:

    # 我 "……还是不肯让我打开。"
    我 "...Still refusing to let me open it."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:222
translate english recall3_a92e95f1:

    # "蓝光在你手背上停了一下，很轻，像有人用指尖碰了碰那行抄歪的圆珠笔字。"
    "" "The blue light rests on the back of your hand for a moment, very light, like fingertips brushing that crooked line of ballpoint."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:223
translate english recall3_9767cd15:

    # 云曦 "别开了。他把钥匙留给了顶层，不是留给你今晚。"
    云曦 "Don't try to open it. He left the key for the rooftop, not for you tonight."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:230
translate english recall3_8df1a7e9:

    # "你把音频的建目录时间、文件名、权限提示抄成三行，天亮后塞进教案夹。"
    "" "You copy out three lines — creation time, filename, permission message — and slip them into the lesson-plan folder at daybreak."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:231
translate english recall3_5d6cb4e4:

    # "社长看完没有抬头，只是把自己那本「可疑事物登记」翻到最新一页，添了第四行。"
    "" "The president finishes reading without lifting her head, turns her own Suspicious Items Register to its newest page, and adds a fourth line."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:236
translate english recall3_fbdc37b1:

    # 知微 "……线索齐了。你只管走路，其余的交给我算。"
    知微 "...The evidence is complete. You only have to keep walking; leave the rest of the calculating to me."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:238
translate english recall3_ea96d72a:

    # "睡前你最后看了一眼桌面。那个灰色的文件夹还在角落里，图标比昨天亮了一点点——大概是你多看了它两眼。"
    "" "Before bed you take one last look at the desktop. That grey folder is still in the corner, its icon a little brighter than yesterday — probably because you glanced at it two more times."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:239
translate english recall3_43e52561:

    # "你把错题本合上，压在那行铅笔字上面。要去顶层的人，今晚先把鞋带系好。"
    "" "You close the mistake notebook and press it down on top of that pencil line. Anyone going up to the rooftop should tie their shoelaces properly tonight."

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:240
translate english recall3_ac06b67b:

    # "「明天，顶层的门只开一次。」"
    "" "'Tomorrow, the rooftop door opens only once.'"

# game/scenes/recall.rpy:241
translate english recall3_d11cd80f:

    # "「而我已经知道，那扇门后面站着的是谁了。」"
    "" "'And I already know who is standing behind that door.'"

